            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at Srirembau Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Mohammed_Zubairi\nDubai, United Arab Emirates36 contributions\n1\nTop notch Authentic Halal Experience\nOct 2019\nWas delightfully surprised to eat at this amazing & probably the only Halal restaurant in the beautiful Halong bay. The menu consisted of some of the authentic Vietnamese delicacies and they were made & served to 100% satisfaction. The taste was authentic, the quality and quantity served was generous. To add more value, as a muslim traveller you will find a dedicated place to offer Salaah at this restaurant. They served one of the BEST spring rolls I've ever had.\n\nHighly recommend this place if you are visiting Halong bay.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 4, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-12",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
